# Handoff — 2026-08-09: MCP D-123/124/125/126 SHIPPED (3d3745f, 3ad838d, 978545f) — Zed config ready; D-127 open (feature-pipeline)

## TL;DR

MCP door tested with REAL clients (official SDK + in-chat MCP tools) → FOUR bugs found, fixed via surgical-change, verified live, committed + pushed:
- **D-123 (High):** only the FIRST connection per gateway worked (shared SDK Server protocol state). Fix: per-request Server + transport.
- **D-124 (Medium):** required `_meta` on every tools request — real clients only send it in initialize. Fix: gate dropped (user-approved), sessionId channel kept.
- **D-125 (Medium):** array-returning caps broke `structuredContent` (SDK schema demands a record). Fix: wrap arrays/null as `{items: …}`.
- **D-126 (High):** business caps unusable — `GATEWAY_SESSION_REQUIRED` (no session auto-mint). Fix: `withAutoMintSession` in adapter-core (CID:adapter-core-009, mirrors CLI D-79) + retry on the adapter. Per the session-manager GRILL contract (per-request short sessions, transparent to client).

