## D-126 verified LIVE (the exact failing scenario)

`tools/call product.list` with NO session → ✅ items from the example app. `cart.add` no session → ✅ totalCents 1999. Auto-minted session shows `archived` after the call (mint → run → destroy). Business-only tokens (no session.create scope) still get GATEWAY_SESSION_REQUIRED (D-91 deny-by-default — correct).

## D-127 (OPEN — feature-pipeline candidate)

Business caps invisible to clients until reconnect — adapter never pushes `notifications/tools/list_changed`. NOT surgical: needs capability-registry events (no event surface exists) + stateful transport (stateless chosen in D-123 has no sendNotification). User observed: tools appeared only after Zed restart. Surgical part done: documented (clients refresh on reconnect).

