## Trap notes

- esbuild bundles BUILT dist: src → `npx tsc -b` (package) → `pnpm run bundle` (packages/agentide) → restart gateway. Stale dist costs hours.
- Kill gateways by PID from `ss -ltnp | grep -oE 'pid=[0-9]+'` — pkill -f bin.bundled doesn't match.
- Tokens expire 1h; app .env tokens too (bounce app + refresh .env).
- `handleTransportRequest` catch swallows transport exceptions silently.
- adapter tests: `pnpm exec vitest run packages/adapter-mcp/src/__tests__/ packages/adapter-core/src/__tests__/` (96/96); full suite 1203/28/0.

